      {
        "id": 3954483282,
        "type": null,
        "body": "Planned as phase 6 of [Object save fixes and arm pricing](https://gitlab.com/max757/Luminari-Source/-/blob/master/docs/ongoing-projects/object-save-fixes-and-arm-pricing.md).\n\nIt shares no code with the other five phases (#19, #18, #15, #16, #17), so it can move anywhere in the order. Production has run the arm count since the 2026-10-04 release, so the pre-deploy check of this item becomes an audit of live data. The production query is read-only and still needs approval when the phase starts.\n\nIts `1-` branch is created from master when the phase starts. The work runs in the worktree `Luminari-Source-object-save-fixes-and-arm-pricing`, now on phase 1 (#19).",
