      {
        "id": 3975341248,
        "type": null,
        "body": "Next up: phase 6 of\n[Object save fixes and arm pricing](https://gitlab.com/max757/Luminari-Source/-/blob/master/docs/ongoing-projects/object-save-fixes-and-arm-pricing.md),\nthe last open phase. #17 (phase 5) merged on 2026-10-08 as `05c76111f`; the other five phases are\nmerged too, so this item shares its worktree with nothing.\n\nThe branch `1-price-extra-arms-and-the-monk-third-hand-after-the-arm-count` was created from\nmaster `55c934d5c` on 2026-10-08, and the worktree `Luminari-Source-object-save-fixes-and-arm-pricing`\nis on it. No code yet.\n\nThe phase has no code change: the prices live in `docs/guides/PLAYER_RACES_REFERENCE.md` alone.\nIts first step is the audit of feat 1320 grants, in the world files first; the read-only query of\nproduction characters and saved objects needs its own approval when the phase starts.",
